---
profile: basic

skip_list:
  # elastic_version, elastic_repo_channel and elastic_version_lock are shared
  # deliberately with the honeynet.elasticsearch and honeynet.logstash roles
  # so that one variable pins the whole stack. They cannot carry a role
  # prefix.
  - var-naming[no-role-prefix]
  # handlers/main.yml keeps upstream's lowercase task-name style even though
  # the module call itself has been modernized (ansible.builtin.systemd
  # instead of the free-form service:). See README.md's Provenance section.
  - name[casing]
